    "body": "The review fix is in `e6e04f5d0`. The writer now saves project version 75. The v74 reader refused an actual v75 Picomax file with `unsupported project version 75 (this build writes 74)`. The v75 reader opened and resaved an actual v74 VMC file. Its machine record compared equal, and both unstated installation fields stayed absent.\n\nThe machine documentation now lists the four script properties. The API documentation explains the direct error result and the engine's earlier refusal. Both call sites now use the same axis-letter check.\n\nPR #3220 also proposes version 75. The second PR to merge needs the next free version. The upstream branch still wrote version 74 at `a35c9cb81`, and a trial merge succeeded at that revision.\n\nThe final gate results are in the PR body. This is ready for a re-check.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
